{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0032_1000_p", "source_sha256": "7fc29022b6b5a6a331b907916255410d958c9df22a76446e77b82d0b5b5734c7", "ja": "そうだ、桃子。この前のクマのぬいぐるみ、\n大事にしてくれてるみたいだな。星梨花に聞いたよ。", "zh": "对了，桃子，之前的小熊布偶，\n听说你很爱惜呢。星梨花都告诉我啰。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0032_1001_049mom", "source_sha256": "40e2e35a46156934f188568408e0714d164459f53420bca928cba49f488fa3c1", "ja": "えっ？　う、うん、まあね……。ねぇお兄ちゃん、\nそれって今日のお仕事と、何か関係あるの？", "zh": "咦？呃、嗯，算是吧……大哥哥，\n那跟今天的工作有什么关系吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0032_1002_p", "source_sha256": "f84d22b588181265c250149be5c3c8b260dd93d5f11f553032489f0743b1f9ff", "ja": "いや、特に関係はないかな？\n星梨花が嬉しそうに話してたから、聞いてみただけで。", "zh": "不，没有什么关系喔？\n只是因为星梨花一脸开心地提起这件事，我才问问而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0032_1003_049mom", "source_sha256": "618a5620c9df471b8c4c96cc30a616a2a51e9af646a533c2f853ce8b6a2c7a57", "ja": "も……もうっ！　桃子はお仕事に集中してるんだから、\n急に変なこと言わないで！", "zh": "真……真是的！桃子正在专心工作，\n不准突然说奇怪的话！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0032_1004_049mom", "source_sha256": "de017f9fdcc30042681003d93e603a46eb0b91482f4ea4dc3d88fdfb1a436f2f", "ja": "それに、みんなからのプレゼントなんだから。\n大事にするのは当たり前でしょ？", "zh": "而且，那是大家送的礼物，\n会爱惜也是理所当然的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0032_1005_p", "source_sha256": "b4530fff8f3250a3dc44d75c69f72fba9ee49e3f31c1d4ebd0debd6cda5cbbcb", "ja": "うん、確かにそうだったな。\n急に変なこと聞いてごめんな、桃子。", "zh": "嗯，确实如此。\n抱歉突然问你这种事，桃子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0032_1006_049mom", "source_sha256": "5fcfda9099edf6a529be702d3d592eab368b900d779b4dac89b0ebaa442bb0cd", "ja": "そうだよ！　だからお兄ちゃんも、\nクマくんのことは心配しないで、お仕事に集中して。", "zh": "就是说啊！\n所以大哥哥你也别再担心熊熊了，专心工作吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0032_1007_p", "source_sha256": "5b2aafa286cec4794a731d140f20e74f9d04e5d09e2e91b4febe1bf205039c78", "ja": "クマくん……そうか。\nクマくんも、桃子と一緒にいられて喜んでるだろうな。", "zh": "熊熊……是吗。\n能跟桃子待在一起，熊熊一定也很开心吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0032_1008_049mom", "source_sha256": "d01de35a29043f062232e14822e1de748def63de3eac1925f688ba776f75f175", "ja": "そ、そんなの、当然だよ！\n……ほらお兄ちゃん、次、桃子の出番！　行くよ！", "zh": "那、那当然！\n……大哥哥，下一个轮到桃子出场了！那桃子要走啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
